  "goodToKnow": "Die Dominanz is dominance: die Dominanz eines Unternehmens am Markt, die Dominanz der Männer in der Politik. In German football, the classic example is FC Bayern München, which won the Bundesliga eleven seasons in a row from 2013 to 2023, until Bayer Leverkusen won without a single defeat in 2024. Dominant means dominant, and dominieren to dominate. From Latin dominus (master). It has no plural."
